        "heading": "From Custom Shapes to Signature Serving Pieces - We Do It All!",
        "text": "<p>At The Home Palette, we work with restaurants, cafés, hotels, caterers, and hospitality brands to create premium, custom crockery and tableware that brings their vision to life. From custom shapes and colours to signature serving pieces, we turn a brand's identity into tableware their guests remember them for.</p><p>Trusted by leading hospitality brands across Pakistan, we bring together thoughtful design, consistent quality, and reliable production to deliver tableware made for your space and built for everyday service.</p>",
